MD simulation of a spring-mass chain with Langevin thermostat.

```gnuplot
set title 'Temperature decay'
set xlabel 't [ps]'
set ylabel 'T [K]'
set key top right
a = 70.0
b = 10
f(x) = a * exp(-x/b)
fit f(x) 'out.dat' u 1:6 via a,b
print(a)
print(b)
p [0:50] 'out.dat' u 1:6 w l lw 2 t 'T_{m}', f(x) w l lw 2 t 'Fit: 38.5 exp(-t/10.1)'

```
